-trips/lomnicky-peak","evidence":{"n_sources":9,"of":15,"urls":["https://www.vt.sk/en/resort/resort-info/cableway-trips/lomnicky-peak","https://www.frommers.com/destinations/the-high-tatras/attractions/cable-car-to-lomnick-stt/","https://twoticketsto.co.uk/lomnicky-stit-cable-car-guide/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Strbske Pleso and the Solisko chairlift","type":"activity","detail":"A glacial lake with a level shore path, and a chairlift from it to 1,840 m for the view down the Mlynicka and Furkotska valleys.","evidence":{"n_sources":6,"of":15,"urls":["https://blog.gopass.travel/en/high-tatras-slovakia-cable-cars-summer/","https://adventurousmiriam.com/high-tatras-slovakia/","https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attractions-g285716-Activities-Vysoke_Tatry_Presov_Region.html"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Hike Krivan","type":"trail","detail":"The hooked peak on the Slovak coat of arms, and the country's sentimental favourite. A long, steep day from the Tri Studnicky trailhead.","season":[6,7,8,9],"evidence":{"n_sources":4,"of":15,"urls":["https://www.earthtrekkers.com/hike-high-tatras-of-slovakia-how-to-plan-your-visit/","https://www.lonelyplanet.com/articles/out-on-a-high-exploring-slovakias-high-tatras","https://www.farawayworlds.com/guides/hiking-in-the-high-tatras"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Rysy","type":"trail","detail":"Climb from the Slovak side and you stand on the highest point in Poland. Chains on the upper section, a full and demanding day.","season":[7,8,9],"evidence":{"n_sources":4,"of":15,"urls":["https://www.earthtrekkers.com/hike-high-tatras-of-slovakia-how-to-plan-your-visit/","https://zannavandijk.co.uk/hiking-in-slovakia/","https://www.farawayworlds.com/guides/hiking-in-the-high-tatras"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Tatranska Magistrala","type":"trail","detail":"The traverse that runs the length of the range, about 45 km, three to four days, and easy to sample for an afternoon between two cabl